+# review-change Step 3, Layer 2 — design-grounding for category: memory (PR #629, base: main)
+# Grounding rule: every source below was read from the base ref (git show main:<path>) or the
+# resolved memory (~/.garura/core/memory/standards/rules/pr.md). Nothing is grounded in ADR 030,
+# the branch's edits to docs/philosophy/idsd.md or ADR 029, or the new plan.md template itself.
+category: memory
+playbook: review/memory
+severity_basis: >
+  standards/rules/pr.md bucket definitions (P3 = missing docs / naming; P4 = nit). No Severity
+  Table row (SEC/ARCH/BE/CODE/TEST/DOC/...) targets templates/ or tools/ prose, so no Standard ID
+  fires; buckets are assigned from the prose definitions of P1-P4 and flagged "no-row".
